shortdesc Custom presentation class built upon LaTeX Beamer
relocated 1
longdesc This class is prepared for short presentations with a modern
longdesc look & feel. It offers the following features: custom
longdesc background for each slide, predefined types of slides,
longdesc simplified commands (e.g. for starting and ending slide). The
longdesc class is built upon LaTeX beamer, so all beamer commands should
longdesc work.
